ヌ、真ん中に互いの宝具をぶつけ合う感じにお願いします\n\n左のイリヤにはセリフに「これが私の全て！」\nメリュジーヌ\n「黄昏の空に──産声のように！」\n真ん中のシーンに「クウィンテットフォイア」\n「ホロウハート・アルビオン」\nと互いに宝具を叫びあってください\n\n細かな要望は左のイリヤと右のメリュジーヌは正面まっすぐカメラ目線のフェイスアップでイリヤは全力の必死な顔でメリュジーヌは戦いを楽しむような狂気に満ちた笑みでお願いします\n可能であればセリフ無しバージョンもお願いします\n最後に可能であれば「カルデアで撮影でした」のオチで第一再臨のイリヤと第二再臨のメリュジーヌがカメラ目線で可愛らしい笑顔でピースした写真風イラストもお願いします\n\n要望が多くて申し訳ありませんが可能な限りでよろしくお願いします", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/27", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 1252440, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2940364b/uploads/origins/8494f284-bae3-46c6-8457-92a98390911f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d049a06c419bdbeed7736ee2f465b4d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2940364b/uploads/origins/8494f284-bae3-46c6-8457-92a98390911f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d36119f1b154b783949cdf82fbbf044c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "miyaka様\n今回依頼ですが、メリュジーヌの第三段階と艦これの初月改二が共に並んでいるイラストをお願いいたします\n前よりもかなり難しい（主に初月改二のイラストを調べていただく手間が）注文だと思いますが、受けていただけると幸いです\nよろしくお願いいたします", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/26", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 3355802, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f4adb3d/uploads/origins/23441d2c-a40f-4ca1-9b9f-9a3c83861787?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=754ed790cfc0f8a086a9a872147b7e0f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f4adb3d/uploads/origins/23441d2c-a40f-4ca1-9b9f-9a3c83861787?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=040d3ee4d4e7da09915ed8cc83f9c804", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして。\n今回は、FGOのメリュジーヌ(第三再臨)とアーテリーギアのニオ(因子化)が共闘する感じのイラストをお願いします。\n構図については、自由で大丈夫です。\n依頼内容ついて書き忘れた箇所があると思い、一部本文を修正ました\nデザインが複雑で大変かもしれませんが、よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 2674154, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b24117d5/uploads/origins/b93429c4-745f-4ec0-a7ac-3379d2f204e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd7aa42a4b30792f2e419e0a68b180ae", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b24117d5/uploads/origins/b93429c4-745f-4ec0-a7ac-3379d2f204e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ee826d5c5ce88a44712d186233e67c4f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめましてこんにちは！\nいつもmiyakaさんのメリュジーヌが大好きで拝見させてもらってます！\n大好きで堪らない絵を描いてくれるmiyakaさんに是非メリュジーヌを描いて頂きたく、よければ添付します資料の私がゲームで操作している自機ちゃんとメリュジーヌが2人で仲良くピースしてるイラストを描いて頂きたいです。(アイコンやら壁紙やらに使わせて頂けたらなと思っています)\nよろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://x.com/aoi_pomme/status/1819637957604921475?s=46", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 1252440, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d54c69e1/uploads/origins/4fa03e36-63a9-4221-ac48-16dc2d945331?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d0d248c5714d764a6d364b053476b1c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d54c69e1/uploads/origins/4fa03e36-63a9-4221-ac48-16dc2d945331?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8075ec7bc9d7372bca7bfe5bafe4d20", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして\n依頼したいイラストですが、クロスオーバーで、FGOのメリュジーヌ（第一再臨）と艦これの初月が好戦的に並んでいるイラストをお願いいたします\n大変ではありますが、よろしくお願いします", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/23", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 3221126, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fcc97e76/uploads/origins/c3f5c6d3-f47e-45b5-bb41-2bad87957ac3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1edf56796e5df1e43a18a815cc77946c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fcc97e76/uploads/origins/c3f5c6d3-f47e-45b5-bb41-2bad87957ac3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ffde94f78ed603f97938cdb2b655eee5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "いつもお世話になっております。\nmiyakaさんの描かれる間桐桜さんをいつも夢見ています♪\n\n後ろ向きで立っている黒桜が振り返り、かっこ良くも妖艶なイメージ、黒のドレスのようなすそが風でめくれ上がり若干太ももが露わになっているイメージ\nそして髪の毛をかきあげるような仕草\n\n車に貼ってみたいと思っているのですが可能でしょうか？", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 1442498, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73c89a5d/uploads/origins/0568466e-c860-40b0-afbf-d3c80e860e23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=179c554265dd511d62219def8deec7a8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73c89a5d/uploads/origins/0568466e-c860-40b0-afbf-d3c80e860e23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f01f1ac00abe80e983ae24c49e8cc010", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Miyakaさん、こんにちは！\nジャンヌとジャンヌオルタてください学生服\nジャンヌは最近の春のキャンペーンから！そしてオルターは試練コール2より\nhttps://twitter.com/fgoproject/status/1774361786436993359  ジャンヌオルタ参考資料\nhttps://twitter.com/fgoproject/status/1775453389687783654  ジャンヌ参考資料", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/21", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 1346475, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75dc544b/uploads/origins/1970e6ee-51ff-437c-afb1-d37d9f303b7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e668cd70eed1bd281f89fc87681ecee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75dc544b/uploads/origins/1970e6ee-51ff-437c-afb1-d37d9f303b7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ffcba929effc30ca38e86312cde3dd4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "First off let me say I absolutely love how cute this image you made of Jeanne D'Arc is https://skeb.jp/@2wasurenagusa1/works/14\n\nI'm looking to ask for something similar. The request would be a picture of Yui Kotegawa and Rito Yuuki from To Loveる　dancing in this pose: https://sta.sh/02g3dg3d0nuo.\n\nAs for details, Yui would be wearing a red dress like this one https://sta.sh/09j6xkarz2g, with a bit more cleavage in the chest. I would also like her to be wearing red heels, like these https://sta.sh/02dmqj4yzi3q, and a necklace. The gap in the dress would be on the right side, showing off her thigh.\n\nI would like Yui's hair to be loose and flying about. I would also like her to have a rose as a hair ornament.\n\nBoth characters should be smiling at each other. Yui's smile should be wide and happy, such as seen here https://sta.sh/0152uca2k87f or your Jeanne D'Arc pic. \n\nI will let you choose what type of clothes Rito would be wearing.\n\nHere are some references for the characters:\n\nYui: https://sta.sh/0152uca2k87f, https://sta.sh/0pxuy6pbgwk, https://sta.sh/01y1pv4cymha, https://sta.sh/01qcagbluoh6, https://sta.sh/0197nt85clfj\n\nRito: https://sta.sh/0rb8oukbpsh, https://sta.sh/0t53ne11xei, https://sta.sh/01hmestw6d2y, https://sta.sh/026i181h5xsb", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 1015488, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2eade99d/uploads/origins/b72992e1-f20d-4dfd-9198-93a152199bf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a242d0017949413dd6cb59ae0a870de5", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2eade99d/uploads/origins/b72992e1-f20d-4dfd-9198-93a152199bf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4169b0f7110b9e3afbe8b3abb6aaac04", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして。\nいつもTwitter等で素敵な絵を拝見させていただいています。\n今回メリュジーヌ宝具5を達成できたので\nmiyaka様が描くメリュジーヌがとても素晴らしく\n記念イラストを是非リクエストさせて下さい。\nドレスを着たメリュジーヌをお願い致します。\nドレスのデザイン、表情、構図等はお任せ致します。\nPCの壁紙にしたいと考えています。\nもしご都合が宜しければお願い致します。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@2wasurenagusa1/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2016200, "client_id": 620658, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b47c577/uploads/origins/3cdd6d67-7fe9-44a4-b8dc-7ceff9d35867?bg=%23fff&auto=form